    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join the Discord</h1><p><br><br>Spirit &amp; Stone is under construction! If you would like to follow along with development and participate in its creation, please join us in Discord by clicking the image above.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932290/extras/425b69cbb797167834fed49099fc0eb3.avif?t=1675111073\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Design buildings in a delightful block based building experience. <br></li><li>Manage your colony of villagers to meet their daily needs.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932290/extras/893607388836780a980aca368b12efc3.poster.avif?t=1675111073\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932290/extras/893607388836780a980aca368b12efc3.webm?t=1675111073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932290/extras/893607388836780a980aca368b12efc3.mp4?t=1675111073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932290/extras/303ec27e1c1aa9301465a09f10cd2e4b.avif?t=1675111073\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Customize buildings by installing specialized rooms to grow your economy. <br></li><li>Craft powerful items to equip onto characters and rooms.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932290/extras/2c62acce722bb0d3ae0ad155c36e5912.avif?t=1675111073\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Install important villagers into industries or convoys.<br></li><li>Befriend yours neighbors and the spirits that dwell in the wilderness.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932290/extras/23277f66723b986bf82c7d6e92b3650b.poster.avif?t=1675111073\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932290/extras/23277f66723b986bf82c7d6e92b3650b.webm?t=1675111073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932290/extras/23277f66723b986bf82c7d6e92b3650b.mp4?t=1675111073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932290/extras/210e68372a59e83568f3ae2bcf54cf03.avif?t=1675111073\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Find balance with the spirits and natural forces of the land.<br></li><li>Claim and settle new lands to start new outposts.<br></li><li>Setup distribution routes for your goods and services.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932290/extras/e2ce5dbb8e516562d29de77c321a6823.poster.avif?t=1675111073\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932290/extras/e2ce5dbb8e516562d29de77c321a6823.webm?t=1675111073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932290/extras/e2ce5dbb8e516562d29de77c321a6823.mp4?t=1675111073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932290/extras/169785e1c3c9bc31b51027028112970b.webp?t=1675111073\" /></div><br>",
